WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:35.210
The landscape is so unreal...

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:39.010
Forest landscape... A sight unique to China.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:44.500
The limestone assumed that peculiar shape after being eroded by the ocean water.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:54.130
We've finally arrived, boys.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.580
T-This is..!

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.730
Well? It's a funny-looking building, isn't it?

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:11.680
This is where the Asian Tournament will take place—the China Tower.

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:15.400
We're finally here.

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.910
I'm getting fired up!

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:22.910
The Asian Tournament Begins!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.930
Welcome to the Beyblade Asian Tournament!

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:33.780
I will serve as the game's referee... I'm Greater DJ!

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.270
Let's have a great time, everybody!

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:43.650
Wow... This DJ guy has come all the way here.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:49.140
The Beybladers here are the best of the best of each Asian country!

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:57.050
And this Asian Tournament will decide strongest out of all of them!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:03:02.000
Now for the rules: the teams will be split into A and B Blocks to fight a qualification round.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.940
The teams will have to keep winning inside their Block in a tournament-format.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:11.480
For each victory, the teams will move to the upper floors.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.780
In other words, the more you win the higher you'll go.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:17.840
In the end is the Final Stadium at the top floor.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.660
Who will be able to reach the top floor?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:25.540
It's the event of the century, a clash of incandescent Blader souls!

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.980
The Asian Tournament starts now!

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:36.290
The A Block will fight in the East Stadium. The B Block will fight in the West Stadium.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:41.730
To all teams, go to your respective stadiums according to the division.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:46.130
Oh, we're fighting the first match of the A Block.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.620
What? We can fight right from the start?

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.610
Takao, you're <i>very very happy</i> aren't you?

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:58.400
Of course I am? I've been waiting for this moment since we left Japan!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.380
I see. So you're in the A Block.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.850
Y-You guys..!

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:06.560
Rai!

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:10.560
Unfortunately, we won't be able to fight you until the Finals.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.340
What are you saying?! What do you mean?

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.690
Look at that.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:23.330
Our team is in the B Block. Yours is in the A Block.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:29.250
So if we don't beat everyone else in our respective Block, we won't be able to fight against each other.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.760
That means our fight is postponed until then.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.500
Be sure to make it to the Finals. Are we clear?

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:40.190
And that is where I will take you down.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.130
Let us meet at the top floor.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.940
Don't get scared and run from our fight.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:46.880
What?!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.750
Don't get cold feet during the preliminaries!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:50.770
Come back, you!

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.770
Let's start the fights!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:58.370
There will be three sets. The first team to win two will move on!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:04:59.060
Okay?

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.490
Then let's go with the first set of the first match.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.210
Thailand's Alanda against...

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.730
Rei from the BBA team!

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.540
I'm going.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:17.860
Rei, get this over quickly! It's a piece of cake!

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.330
It's a piece of cake?!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.390
W-What? What's wrong?

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:27.660
Takao, you shouldn't take these fights lightly.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:33.320
That's right. Everyone here is representing their own counties. You mustn't underestimate them.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:39.110
The sooner we can get these stupid preliminaries over with, the sooner we get to fight Kiki's team!

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.600
"Stupid preliminaries" you say...

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.790
Whatever, you'll understand sooner or later.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.920
Just sit there and look at my fight.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:52.200
Tsk! What's with him?

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:56.950
Very well!

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.180
Let me show it to you! Open the Special Stadium!

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.100
W-What's with <i>that</i>..?!

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:19.970
W-Wow, this is incredible! The Bey Stadium for the preliminaries is the China Diorama Staduium!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.660
Mountain ranges stand tall, and a large river flows among them!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:30.340
Who will overcome these obstacles and seize victory?

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.790
W-What's with this stadium..?!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:38.720
Well, Takao? They've prepared something like <i>this</i> and we're just at the preliminaries.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.070
Did this open your eyes a bit, Takao?

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:47.430
Interesting! I'm getting more and more fired up!

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:51.230
It seems our warning was useless.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:57.220
Come on, boys. Show me some great battles.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:09.450
I see... That doesn't look like the average Beyblade.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:14.450
Contestants, are you ready? Let's start the count down!

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:18.080
Three, Two, One!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.580
Go.... Shoot!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.380
Go, Driger!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:38.400
Wow! Right from the start, a head-on clash!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.020
Not bad.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:47.870
Wow... He can keep up with Driger's power!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:51.160
Driger still has his secret move Tiger Claw, you know?!

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:56.210
Go, Driger! End this with your Tiger Claw!

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.130
What..?!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.630
Driger...

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.980
was blown away!

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:15.480
Oh! Will Driger fall into one of the river courses that have been set around the stadium?

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.290
Oh boy, that was close...

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.280
Did you see the power of my Yakku Attack?

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.660
That technique! Could that be..?

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.000
What, Professor?

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:36.690
That's right. Yakku is the name one of the demons that exist in Thai legends.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:42.800
Just like the demon god who keeps attacking without mercy. This is the origin of this techinque's name!

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:50.760
That move is outside of my calculations! According to my analysis, it's three times more powerful than the Tiger's Claw!

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.260
Are you for real?!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:56.320
It appears this won't be "a piece of cake" after all.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:57.760
What?!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.320
What would have happened if it was you fighting this battle?

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:08.480
Rei, <i>never give up</i>! Do your best!

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.130
I know!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.820
It's about time we end this.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.180
Oh no you don't!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:33.890
What amazing strength! It can break apart even the rocky mountains!

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.760
Go! Destroy everything in your path!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.570
Did I do it?

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:51.350
Attacking power is very important in a Bey Battle.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:52.770
But...

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.040
You can't win with power alone!

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:07.570
Crap! It got tripped up on the sandy terrain!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:25.420
Wow! This is what they call a comeback victory!

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:31.440
Driger's strategy wins! The first set is won by Rei!

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:41.670
We're only at the preliminaries, and yet the battles are already this intense... This is too exciting!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:42.900
I'm getting fired up!

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:56.460
Okay, the BBA team won the first set.

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.970
And now, the second set will pit Max against Birut!

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.450
What's wrong? Make your move!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:20.450
Wow! Max's Bey can't find a way to go and is just standing still!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:24.970
Still, what's with this heat? Did every air conditioner suddenly break?!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.240
Why is it so hot..?

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.040
It's just as I thought.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:34.770
The cause of this heat... is him!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.160
Uh, what..?

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:42.750
According to the data we just received, the friction caused by the high-speed rotation of Birut's Beyblade...

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.980
is causing this heat?!

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:47.680
There's no way something like that can be real!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.100
Look at this.

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:54.320
The data shows that the temperature around that Bey is a hundred times higher than normal.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:58.070
A normal Beyblade can't resist against that.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.080
I-It's so hot...

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:11.260
How do you like my Fever Attack, inspired by Thailand's heat?

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:15.240
Explain this, Professor! Why is <i>he</i> fine with the heat?!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.500
Probably...

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:23.500
I built it using special heat-resistant materials! How long will your Blade last?

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:33.300
This is bad! If this keeps up, Draciel's Body will melt!

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.610
Draciel!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.210
Go on, melt!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.890
It's over. Victory is mine.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.560
I can't...

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:10.480
Wait a second! To generate such powerful friction, you need to make something heavy spin at high velocity.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:15.600
This means it should be using up an incredible amount of stamina to keep it up!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.360
Dang it! Go down already!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.120
Crap! The rotational speed is slowing down!

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:30.610
This is it! Max, now's your chance! Your opponent is running on fumes!

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:32.960
<i>Yes.</i> Okay.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:36.930
<i>Now go</i>, Draciel!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.450
W-What..?!

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:52.420
Did Draciel's special system, the Metal Balls, activate? It's going into high-speed rotation mode!

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.970
Go, Draciel!

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:57.980
Why you..!

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.490
<i>Never give up!</i>

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:08.650
Wow! Draciel closes in for a series of consecutive attacks!

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.650
With this you're <i>finished</i>!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.840
O-Oh crap!

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.430
He did it!

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.610
What... What happened?

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.170
Did Max win the match..?

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.660
H-How could that be..?!

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:35.310
This is unbelievable! They defeated an opponent powerful enough to engulf the entire stadium in scorching heat!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.940
The BBA team passes the preliminaries!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.820
Thank goodness the temperature went back to normal!

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:42.690
Great job, Max!

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:44.240
You were great.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:45.690
That was an awesome fight.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.540
To struggle this much against such a small fry...

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:51.180
Kai, you don't have to say it like <i>that</i>!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.310
<i>Okay, okay!</i> Don't worry.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:58.050
This is just how Kai talks. In reality, you're happy for my victory, right?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:02.960
You're next, Takao. Please don't lower your guard.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.390
I know.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:10.740
After seeing Rei and Max's fights I understand. These preliminaries are worth fighting all out.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:13.450
As expected from the Asian Tournament!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:16.340
And now, here is the last set, the third one!

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:19.900
Can the Thai team change their fate in these last moments?

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:27.850
Oh, what's going on? Kochan of the Thai team doesn't appear to be holding a Beyblade!

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:32.310
Don't worry. My Shooter is... right here!

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:35.030
Ton Yan Khan!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:41.280
I-Incredible! This is unheard of! He has mounted his Shooter to his leg!

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:44.100
Can he really shoot from there?!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:51.930
You're called Takao or something, right? We might have lost the prelminary... But I will defeat you will all I've got!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:57.680
I've been itching to fight all this time! I'm going all out!

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:01.610
Are you ready? Let's start the third set!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:09.330
W-Why is that guy dancing at a time like this?!

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:17.090
Those movements... I'm sure I've seen them somewhere before!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.830
Three, Two, One!

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:25.180
Go... Shoot!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.600
Go, Dragoon!

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:36.260
Wow! Kochan's Beyblade advances with an intense energy!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:40.490
Now I remember! those leg
movements come from Muay Thai!

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:43.520
<i>Hey</i>, Professor! <i>What's</i> Muay Thai?!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:48.020
It's a type of boxing from Thailand. Another name for it is Kick Boxing.

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:55.530
It's a martial art with a vast range of movements that don't only use fists but also elbows, knees and even legs to attack.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:17:01.240
He performed an incredibly powerful shoot with a Muay Thai-style kick.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.000
Don't lose, Dragoon!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:20.690
Here it is! Dragoon's secret technique, the Storm Attack!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.050
Alright, the match is ours!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:37.240
Oh, what's happening now? The storm created by Dragoon is bringing the water from the stadium's rivers up in the air!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:44.240
Crap! I can't use the storm Attack in a place like this!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.490
The real fight starts now!

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:48.390
What?!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:57.010
Oh, this is amazing! Kochan's Beyblade keeps relentlessly attacking Dragoon with moves resembling a dance!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:00.770
<i>Unbelievable!</i> It's like magic!

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:03.780
There must be some special mechanism inside the Blade Base.

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:10.370
He's probably making the Bey itself jump using the metal balls inside to attack from above.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:14.180
That move resembles Kai's Spin Fire Bomb.

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:18.640
It doesn't have the same destructive power.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:19.780
But...

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:23.090
if it keeps attacking like that it <i>will</i> do some serious damage.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:27.750
Focusing on the Attack Ring and the Bey's axis. It's just like Kick Boxing.

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:32.630
Dragoon's in trouble! Will he give up the victory to Kochan?!

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:39.760
Yeah, I can't use the wind. But Dragoon's rotational speed hasn't dropped one bit!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.930
Stop screwing around!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.890
Dragoon, pushed off by Kochan's Beyblade is falling down!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:50.360
With this you're done!

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:55.860
Oh! The Kochan's Beyblade goes after Dragoon! Is it planning to attack him from above?

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.860
I was waiting for this moment!

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:03.630
W-What?!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.240
My Beyblade..!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.700
Alright, I did it!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:21.090
This is my improvised secret
technique, the Water Jet Storm!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:29.540
Wow! The water splashed by Dragoon blew away Kochan's Bey! With this, Takao wins the third set!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.270
Mister Takao.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.280
This was a great battle. I have no regrets.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:41.470
Thank you.

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:47.030
All this formality is making me feel out of place.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.830
Same here. I enjoyed our fight.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:53.540
Good work, everyone. It really was a good show.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.500
So how does it feel to fight against the world?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:20:03.510
It's the best! Fighting opponents this strong even at the preliminaries... It's like a dream!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:08.940
Oh, that reminds me. The Chinese team is fighting their battle right now.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:12.560
They're at the West Stadium. They're up against the Brunei kingdom's team.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:17.680
The Brunei kingdom?! They're one of the favorites to win this tournament!

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:22.900
Wait, are you serious? What will happen if Rai and the others lose here?

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:26.290
Anyway, let's <i>hurry up</i> to their stadium!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:36.160
The Chinese team has already won twice!

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:40.340
Aren't they fighting one of
the favorites? What's going on..?

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:50.170
That's..!

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:51.730
The light coming from the Bit..!

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.030
Her Bey has a Sacred Beast too?!

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:01.930
Take this! Cat Fang!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.420
She's strong! Overwhelmingly so!

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:14.780
That girl's a <i>Wonder Woman</i>!

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:16.510
This is cool!

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:19.040
This is so cool!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:22.010
This is making my fighting spirit roar!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:26.960
Enjoy this time while it last! Wait for when you'll be up against us!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:56.950 --> 00:22:58.480
According to my analysis,

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:00.990
Rei has been acting weird.

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:04.730
He can't seem to calm down since the moment we met the Chinese team.

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:07.890
And then there's Kiki... He's just as weird!

00:23:07.890 --> 00:23:13.350
He visited the BBA Team in the middle of the night... What's his plan?

00:23:13.350 --> 00:23:16.960
And now out of the blue, he's fighting Rei?!

00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:20.530
Next time: Rei Loses Byakko!

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:24.430
Oh no! What's going to happen now?!
